 even when she's making tea?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_24","text":"I'm not 100% sure myself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_25","text":"The Queen is wondering","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_26","text":"which type of tea you prefer?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_27","text":"Black tea,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_28","text":"or green tea?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_29","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_29","text":"Black tea.","jump":"m_ex_unlimited_02_31"},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_30","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_30","text":"Green tea.","jump":"m_ex_unlimited_02_31"},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_31","text":"Wow, I didn't expect that :O","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_32","text":"I thought you would prefer sweet tea!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_33","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_33","text":"What makes you ask?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_34","text":"Ah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_35","text":"Queen wants to have afternoon tea :)","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_36","text":"But unfortunately, she is out of your favorite tea :'(","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_37","text":"Next time, then!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_38","text":"Servant,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_39","text":"I hope you are not too disappointed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_40","text":"Queen wanted me to tell you that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_41","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_42","text":"I hope we can have afternoon tea together","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_43","text":"sooner rather than later!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_44","text":"Me, too.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_unlimited_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"alice","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_unlimited_02_45","text":"^_^","jump":null}],"chat":true}